{"id":46044,"date":"2025-10-25T11:03:11","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T10:03:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/axtrail-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-06T18:35:59","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T17:35:59","slug":"axtrail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/axtrail\/","title":{"rendered":"AXTrail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">AXTrail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>UTAX AXtrail 2026<\/strong> realiza-se entre os dias <strong>16 e 18 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, afirmando-se como uma das maiores refer\u00eancias do trail running nacional e internacional. Com epicentro na Pra\u00e7a da Notabilidade em <strong>Castanheira de Pera<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>, o evento percorre os trilhos ancestrais e as cumeadas da <strong>Serra da Lous\u00e3<\/strong>, unindo a beleza r\u00fastica das <strong>Aldeias do Xisto<\/strong> a um desafio desportivo de elei\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa competitivo \u00e9 composto pelo m\u00edtico <strong>UTAX (107 km)<\/strong> com partida noturna na sexta-feira, o <strong>TSL (56 km)<\/strong> no s\u00e1bado (palco da Final Europeia da ITRA National League), o <strong>Trail do Xisto (33 km)<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail do Xisto (16 km)<\/strong> e o <strong>Caminho do Xisto (8 km)<\/strong> no domingo, al\u00e9m de provas dedicadas aos jovens no AXtrail Kids e \u00e0 inclus\u00e3o social.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">16 a 18 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding